WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.477
This is personal work.

00:00:01.477 --> 00:00:05.538
Fill the offer canvas completely before you pretend you are done.

00:00:05.538 --> 00:00:08.491
This lesson is about personal: offer canvas filled.

00:00:08.491 --> 00:00:09.968
Attachment: canvas PDF habit.

00:00:09.968 --> 00:00:12.552
Do not treat this as theory only.

00:00:12.552 --> 00:00:16.244
Treat it as a move you can run this week.

00:00:16.244 --> 00:00:21.782
By the end, you should be able to act without waiting for a perfect plan.

00:00:21.782 --> 00:00:25.843
Keep the DigProg habit: watch, practice, then take one real action.

00:00:25.843 --> 00:00:29.904
Stay practical: complete offer canvas before you optimize branding or tools.

00:00:30.224 --> 00:00:35.112
Complete every box: who, problem, promise, process, price, next step, includes, excludes.

00:00:35.112 --> 00:00:37.556
Remember the objective: complete offer canvas.

00:00:37.556 --> 00:00:42.037
Write the idea in your own words before you move on.

00:00:42.037 --> 00:00:46.926
Name one concrete next action you can finish in under an hour.

00:00:46.926 --> 00:00:51.407
Avoid vanity work that feels busy but does not create proof.

00:00:51.407 --> 00:00:56.295
If something is unclear, simplify the promise and try a smaller version.

00:00:56.295 --> 00:00:59.147
Talk to a real person when possible.

00:00:59.147 --> 00:01:00.776
Feedback beats guessing alone.

